        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Capture</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the magical mayhem of Frogs vs Ducks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Game</strong><br>Magical Capture is a fast, clever twist on classic strategy games. Think checkers—if checkers had magical creatures, enchanted cubes, and a whole lot more mischief. It’s quick to pick up, surprisingly deep, and full of wild moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812840/extras/d17a1af18ecc105b333632c52f398f28.poster.avif?t=1783514021\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812840/extras/d17a1af18ecc105b333632c52f398f28.webm?t=1783514021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812840/extras/d17a1af18ecc105b333632c52f398f28.mp4?t=1783514021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧊 <strong>Cube-Powered Captures</strong>: Use magic cubes to trap, block, or snatch your opponent’s pieces in unexpected ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐸 <strong>Frogs vs Ducks</strong>: Choose your side and battle with quirky charm and spell-slinging flair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔄 <strong>No Two Games Alike</strong>: With shape-shifting moves and cube-based chaos, every match is a fresh showdown</p></li></ul>",
